{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_11_level_main_11-17_beg",
  "groupId": "main_11",
  "stageId": "main_11-17",
  "title": "To Single Out Fate",
  "storyCode": "11-19",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-17_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "22650d01e35bd9b5010b408d8e22d6ec2991f8ba1479b10eb59719acf0cdc1fe",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "In front of you, Siege!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Is that...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A suit of steam armor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spurts of white steam stand out in front of the dark hue of the armor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Spurt after spurt.\nLike breathing.\nThe fog parts before him. He awakens from history.\nNothing can stop him. Nothing can defeat him.\nNot abandonment, not betrayal.\nNot even death."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "It's moving! Look, it's moving!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Man alive, what is happening here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "Agh! Bolts do nothing!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "Get the grenades!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The massive suit of armor rises from the rubble.\nHeavy footsteps.\nHeavy gushing.\nIt walks toward the panicked crowd, one step at a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Steam Armor'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "text": "(Heavy gushing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "There's no point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "You're from Sargon, Totter. You wouldn't understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "They were the stuff of our bedtime stories."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "It's still stories of the Steam Knights I tell when I put my kids to bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "How are we supposed to defeat him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "How do we defeat our pride, our glory, our hero, who's already been betrayed once?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "We can't defeat him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "This is a... a Victorian Steam Knight."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "Fall back! Fall back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "What's that sound?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Sounds like steam."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "How?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Definitely steam. They're back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "I know I backed the right one! This is where Vina hid her joker!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Morgan, we've got the Steam Knights on our side!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "There are Steam Knights left in Londinium? Here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "Are they guarding the Mausoleum of Kings? The Sighs of Kings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Ha, who cares what they're doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Vina is their king!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "When we come out up top with the Steam Knights, those Sarkaz will... hey, Morgan, what's that look on your face for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "Vina's gonna get the Sighs of Kings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "Four years. The Steam Knights have stayed by the sword for four years, in this sunless dungeon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "They didn't show up when the Sarkaz occupied the city. They didn't show up when the Sarkaz took over the factories. They didn't show up when the Sarkaz burned the noble houses."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "What do they think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "Are they gonna side with intruders into the Mausoleum of Kings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "Who's there?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Take your weapon, Morgan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "They're strong... they're all around us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Hah, this is getting interesting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Why are the hoodlums of Norport here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "The Glasgow Gang? Under Alexandrina?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "Show your face, now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hmph. There are enough variables without that sound of gushing steam rising in Londinium again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What would the Duke think if she knew there were survivors among the Steam Knights?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Would she be uneasy? Or glad that the glorious heroes of old have returned?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ha, glory..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Let's take care of the hoodlums. Don't let them get in Allerdale's way."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Steam Armor'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "text": "(Heavy gushing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "...Steam Knights."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Four years... there are survivors among the Steam Knights?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Those marks... they should have been lethal wounds. The Sarkaz spikes destroyed the cores. There's no way the wearer would survive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Plus, no one could enter or leave the Mausoleum of Kings without the royal key."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "He's spent four years in this dark dungeon..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Even if he survived the initial carnage, how could he have survived in this place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "What does the man in the armor look like now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Steam Armor'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "text": "(Heavy gushing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "Who are... you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "No... what are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A flame sparks in the helmet of the armor.\nAllerdale can feel a cold gaze upon herself.\nUpon everyone here.\nThe flame..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The armor roaring in the flames.\nIt was a dream from her childhood.\nHer hope for salvation.\nThe destruction that she witnessed with her own eyes.\nA nightmare, too terrible to gaze upon."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He is back. Back before her.\nAllerdale cannot keep herself from trembling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "Have you come to settle this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Steam Armor'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "text": "(Heavy gushing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Allerdale!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Look out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Steam Knight, I am Alexandrina Vina Victoria, heir to the Aslan kings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Halt your attack, knight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "We are not your enemies."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Steam Armor'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Siege hears a voice echo above her head.\nWas it the Steam Knight? She is unsure. It sounded more like the rumbling of a machine than a human voice.\nThe spurts of white steam become more rapid and forceful.\nThe dark knight raises his massive weapon towards her.\n'Victoria.'\nSiege suddenly understands. The Steam Knight is not calling her name.\nIt is looking at her sword.\nThe Sighs of Kings, the symbol of the royal house of Victoria."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Last Steam Knight'",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "'Victoria.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He called the sword Victoria.\nThe Victoria that he swore to defend unto his last breath.\nGlorious Victoria betrayed him. Now, he will defend the symbol of Victoria.\nThe last knight of the empire shall take revenge on all those who transgress against her.\nHe charges towards the heir to the throne."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Get out of the way, Siege!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Why did the Steam Knight attack you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Can't he tell...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "Get down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Argh... *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "The sword of fire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "Don't let it hit you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "It's gone mad! We can't stop it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Get out of here! Get out! Get out..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Mercenary",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "We'll all be dead before long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Get your men out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "Do as Vina says."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "Mission aborted, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Totter",
      "speakerId": "avg_4062_totter_1",
      "text": "Looks like my retirement plan will have to wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Dagda, take the mercs and get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Your Highness!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "You're the last one who bowed to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Take their story back, let it see the light of day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "The story belongs to all of us, Siege."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "We should tell it together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "I don't know what's come over you, Allerdale."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "I used to respect you. I thought you were worthy of a knight's honor. No, you were a knight paragon in my mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Always at the forefront, not caring for fame and fortune, not afraid of any foe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "You were Cumberland the Ever on High!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "Nothing can remain on High forever, Dagda."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "But we fought together, didn't we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Your story is here too, Allerdale."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "If you want to come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "I can't do that, can I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "It depends on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "But first, we deal with this knight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "My master taught me that a duel between knights must be fair and honorable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Our foe is a glorious hero."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "Allow me to stand by your side, Your Highness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "...Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "Fight... him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "A pathetic, despicable, lying traitor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "How can one like that challenge fate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "It's a wonderful fable, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "An innocent child wanted to become a hero. But she went bad, and when the hero returned from history, she found his sword at her throat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "The story should end with her death."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "She should lose everything. Never to fulfill her destiny."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "Vina, I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "I don't want to hear you talk about 'destiny' anymore, Allerdale."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Hold your head high, Allerdale Cumberland. There is no such thing as destiny, for me or for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "I need to calm him down. Then, if you still want this sword, all you need to do is challenge me, and I'll abide."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "This is not your bloody destiny, Allerdale. What you want to do, do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "But don't say that word anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'The Last Steam Knight'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_651_1",
      "text": "(Heavy gushing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "He's coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
